{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 20, "width": 424, "height": 30.0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "D. ¿Conviene sincronizar ahora?", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 24, "containerId": null, "originalText": "D. ¿Conviene sincronizar ahora?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t0"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 56, "width": 728, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PD-7 + PD-4 + PD-8. Catorce casos. Tres preguntas que se responden antes de abrir la transferencia.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-7 + PD-4 + PD-8. Catorce casos. Tres preguntas que se responden antes de abrir la transferencia.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t1"}, {"type": "line", "x": 10, "y": 88, "width": 1190, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#d4d4d8", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "points": [[0, 0], [1190, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "l2"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 108, "width": 122, "height": 21.25, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "ITERACIÓN #1", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ITERACIÓN #1", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t3"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 132, "width": 255, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "Tres preguntas, y el orden importa", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tres preguntas, y el orden importa", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t4"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 164, "width": 283, "height": 270.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "1. Antes de bajar un solo byte el nodo se\n   hace tres preguntas, y el orden\n   importa.\n\n2. Primero: ¿conviene sincronizar ahora?\n   Mira la red, el horario y la energía.\n\n3. Segundo: ¿cuánto me atrasé? Puede ser\n   una semana o pueden ser cuatro.\n\n4. Tercero: ¿me cabe en el disco? La\n   activación atómica necesita dos\n   versiones al mismo tiempo.\n\n5. Si cualquiera da que no, no se abre la\n   transferencia. Esperar cuesta cero;\n   empezar y no terminar desperdicia la\n   ventana.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Antes de bajar un solo byte el nodo se\n   hace tres preguntas, y el orden\n   importa.\n\n2. Primero: ¿conviene sincronizar ahora?\n   Mira la red, el horario y la energía.\n\n3. Segundo: ¿cuánto me atrasé? Puede ser\n   una semana o pueden ser cuatro.\n\n4. Tercero: ¿me cabe en el disco? La\n   activación atómica necesita dos\n   versiones al mismo tiempo.\n\n5. Si cualquiera da que no, no se abre la\n   transferencia. Esperar cuesta cero;\n   empezar y no terminar desperdicia la\n   ventana.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t5"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 390, "y": 180, "width": 180, "height": 78, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r6"}, {"type": "text", "x": 390, "y": 196.375, "width": 180, "height": 18.75, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "¿Ahora?", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "¿Ahora?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t7"}, {"type": "text", "x": 390, "y": 217.125, "width": 180, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PD-7", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-7", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t8"}, {"type": "text", "x": 390, "y": 230.375, "width": 180, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "red, clase, energía", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "red, clase, energía", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t9"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 612, "y": 180, "width": 180, "height": 78, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r10"}, {"type": "text", "x": 612, "y": 196.375, "width": 180, "height": 18.75, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "¿Cuánto?", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "¿Cuánto?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t11"}, {"type": "text", "x": 612, "y": 217.125, "width": 180, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PD-4", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-4"