rsión, no alcanza", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t81"}, {"type": "text", "x": 702, "y": 1054.25, "width": 155, "height": 22.5, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "lo esencial primero,\nquedar PAUSED", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "lo esencial primero,\nquedar PAUSED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t82"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 867, "y": 1004, "width": 155, "height": 94, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r83"}, {"type": "text", "x": 867, "y": 1018.375, "width": 155, "height": 27.5, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "SALTO DE\nVERSIONES", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SALTO DE\nVERSIONES", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t84"}, {"type": "text", "x": 867, "y": 1047.875, "width": 155, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "varias, alcanza", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "varias, alcanza", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t85"}, {"type": "text", "x": 867, "y": 1061.125, "width": 155, "height": 22.5, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "comparar contra la\nmás nueva, activar directo", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "comparar contra la\nmás nueva, activar directo", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t86"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 1032, "y": 1004, "width": 155, "height": 94, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r87"}, {"type": "text", "x": 1032, "y": 1018.375, "width": 155, "height": 27.5, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "SALTO CON\nVENTANA CORTA", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SALTO CON\nVENTANA CORTA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t88"}, {"type": "text", "x": 1032, "y": 1047.875, "width": 155, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "varias, no alcanza", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "varias, no alcanza", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t89"}, {"type": "text", "x": 1032, "y": 1061.125, "width": 155, "height": 22.5, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "por prioridad; sigue\ncon su versión anterior", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "por prioridad; sigue\ncon su versión anterior", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t90"}, {"type": "text", "x": 372, "y": 1116, "width": 290, "height": 37.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "ESCUELA EN s9, PENDIENTES s10 s11 s12\ndelta encadenado   369 MB   49 min\nestado completo    185 MB   25 min    50% menos", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ESCUELA EN s9, PENDIENTES s10 s11 s12\ndelta encadenado   369 MB   49 min\nestado completo    185 MB   25 min    50% menos", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t91"}, {"type": "text", "x": 760, "y": 1120, "width": 461, "height": 37.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "La guía viaja una sola vez, en su versión final: las versiones v2 y v3 que s12 ya\nreemplazó nunca se descargan. Y la ficha publicada en s10 sí baja, porque sigue\nvigente en el manifiesto de s12. Diego no pierde nada.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "La guía viaja una sola vez, en su versión final: las versiones v2 y v3 que s12 ya\nreemplazó nunca se descargan. Y la ficha publicada en s10 sí baja, porque sigue\nvigente en el manifiesto de s12. Diego no pierde nada.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t92"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 350, "y": 1230, "width": 840, "height": 254, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r93"}, {"type": "text", "x": 362, "y": 1236, "width": 192, "height": 13.75, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "¿ME CABE EN EL DISCO?  ·  PD-8", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "¿ME CABE EN EL DISCO?  ·  PD-8", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t94"}, {"type": "r