 null, "text": "solo lo esencial,\nalertar al administrador", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "solo lo esencial,\nalertar al administrador", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t106"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 990, "y": 1258, "width": 190, "height": 94, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r107"}, {"type": "text", "x": 990, "y": 1272.375, "width": 190, "height": 27.5, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "DISCO LLENO\nCON COLA", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "DISCO LLENO\nCON COLA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t108"}, {"type": "text", "x": 990, "y": 1301.875, "width": 190, "height": 11.25, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "no cabe, cola pendiente", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "no cabe, cola pendiente", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t109"}, {"type": "text", "x": 990, "y": 1315.125, "width": 190, "height": 22.5, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "enviar la cola primero,\njamás borrarla", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "enviar la cola primero,\njamás borrarla", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t110"}, {"type": "text", "x": 372, "y": 1370, "width": 302, "height": 50.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "JERARQUIA DE BORRADO\n1. multimedia opcional de versiones antiguas\n2. versiones antiguas completas, menos la activa\n3. NUNCA: version activa, cola de eventos, indice", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "JERARQUIA DE BORRADO\n1. multimedia opcional de versiones antiguas\n2. versiones antiguas completas, menos la activa\n3. NUNCA: version activa, cola de eventos, indice", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t111"}, {"type": "text", "x": 790, "y": 1370, "width": 158, "height": 75.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "MINIMO POR NODO\nversion activa     3.0 GB\nversion nueva      3.0 GB\ncola e indices     0.5 GB\nSO y margen        1.5 GB\n                   8.0 GB", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "MINIMO POR NODO\nversion activa     3.0 GB\nversion nueva      3.0 GB\ncola e indices     0.5 GB\nSO y margen        1.5 GB\n                   8.0 GB", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t112"}, {"type": "text", "x": 372, "y": 1444, "width": 456, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "Lo que solo existe en la escuela vale más que lo que Lima puede volver a mandar.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Lo que solo existe en la escuela vale más que lo que Lima puede volver a mandar.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t113"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 372, "y": 1508, "width": 470, "height": 132, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r114"}, {"type": "text", "x": 386, "y": 1518, "width": 229, "height": 13.75, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PEORES CASOS QUE ATAJA ESTE DIAGRAMA", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PEORES CASOS QUE ATAJA ESTE DIAGRAMA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t115"}, {"type": "text", "x": 386, "y": 1540, "width": 304, "height": 112.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "P1   la ventana de conexión no alcanza nunca\nP11  manifiesto como delta encadenado\nP12  el manifiesto describe solo su semana\nP13  descargar las versiones en orden s10, s11, s12\nP14  atraso permanente invisible\nP20  sincronizar sin límite durante la clase\nP21  todas las escuelas sincronizan a la misma hora\nP23  nodo dimensionado a 4 GB\nP24  disco al 100%: no se puede registrar ni el fallo", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "P1   la ventana de conexión no alcanza nunca\nP11  manifiesto como delta encadenado\nP12  el manifiesto describe solo su semana\nP13  descargar las versiones en orden s10, s11, s12\nP14  atraso permanente invisible\nP20  sincronizar sin límite durante la clase\nP21  todas las escuelas sincronizan a la misma hora\nP23  nodo dimensionado a 4 GB\nP24  disco al 100%: no se puede registrar ni el fallo", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t116"}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}